      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FARMOR MYSTERY (3) shows ability but remains a maiden after 16 starts. Is better than last start when out of the placings, finishing fourth (24.29) at this track. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Should be very hard to beat this time. MINI MATILDA (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.41) at this track behind Marzhew in a Grade 6/MDN. Has the pace to be prominent. Safe beginner but has a tricky box to overcome. Expected to feature. LITTLE HILL (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (24.00) at this track in a Maiden over 407m. Expected to feature. ENGINE EMMA (1) can find the frame without surprising.",
